  "body": "Step into effortless modern living with this beautifully designed single-level home, perfectly positioned in one of Orewa’s exciting new neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nOffering three generous bedrooms, two stylish bathrooms and an impressively spacious open-plan living area, this home has been thoughtfully crafted for those who value comfort, quality and easy living. From the elevated rear decking, enjoy peaceful open views across the surrounding landscape – a wonderful place to relax with your morning coffee or unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a designer kitchen complete with a large island, walk-in pantry and abundant storage, seamlessly connecting to the light-filled dining and living space. Large sliding doors create excellent indoor-outdoor flow to both entertaining and viewing decks, making everyday living feel effortlessly spacious.\r\n\r\nThe master suite enjoys its own ensuite and wardrobe, while the beautifully appointed family bathroom features a luxurious freestanding bathtub for the ultimate place to unwind.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n\r\n• Central ducted air conditioning throughout\r\n• Designer kitchen with walk-in pantry and generous storage\r\n• Luxurious freestanding bathtub and tiled bathrooms\r\n• Elevated outlook with peaceful open views\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to multiple decking areas\r\n• Dedicated off-street parking\r\n• Low-maintenance freehold section\r\n\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Orewa Beach, schools, motorway access and the growing Milldale amenities, this home offers the perfect balance of lifestyle, comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nPerfect for downsizers, professional couples, retirees or small families seeking modern comfort without compromise.",
